# 🌍 S3 Static Website

A fully deployed static website hosted on AWS S3, demonstrating real-world
cloud hosting practices.

## Steps
1. Create S3 bucket (globally unique name)
2. Disable "Block all public access"
3. Enable **Static website hosting**
4. Set index + error documents
5. Bucket policy to allow `s3:GetObject` for `*`
6. Upload `index.html`, `style.css`, assets
7. Access via S3 website endpoint
8. _(Optional)_ Front with CloudFront + ACM cert for HTTPS

## Bucket Policy
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [{
    "Sid": "PublicReadGetObject",
    "Effect": "Allow",
    "Principal": "*",
    "Action": "s3:GetObject",
    "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::YOUR-BUCKET/*"
  }]
}
